    "text": "By Lanie Gatson, Star City News ,\n10 hours ago A new mural is honoring the life and legacy of famed aviator Amelia Earhart. You can find it on the side of Wanderlust Coffee Roasters in downtown Lafayette. Community members gathered Tuesday evening for a dedication ceremony celebrating one of Indiana's most influential historic figures. Leaders say the mural serves... Read full article\n1",
